Package: hydrovur
Title: HydroVu Public API Client
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: 
    person("Skyler", "Lewis", , "slewis@flowwest.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: A connection-oriented R client for the HydroVu public REST API.
    Provides cached access to locations and parameter friendly-names, fetches
    sensor readings over arbitrary time windows, and offers an optional helper
    for windowed upserts into a PostgreSQL backend.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
Encoding: UTF-8
